001  SHOT_01  V     C        01:00:00:00 01:00:10:00 00:00:00:00 00:00:10:00
* FROM CLIP NAME: LS_SteamTrailer_Shot01_DivanKhanaTable_35mm.exr
* COMMENT: LENS: 35mm Prime, f/2.0 | AUDIO_CUE: Hearth_And_Vedeno_Watermill_Layer3
* LOC_TITLE_RU: Кадр 1: Очаг Диван-ханы и карта Кавказа при свечах
* LOC_TITLE_EN: Shot 1: Divan-Khana Hearth & Candlelit Caucasus Map
* SUBTITLE_EN: "Vedeno, 1845. Across this oak table there are no abstract hexes — only couriers, gunpowder, and the will of ten Naibs..."

002  SHOT_02  V     C        01:00:10:00 01:00:20:00 00:00:10:00 00:00:20:00
* FROM CLIP NAME: LS_SteamTrailer_Shot02_ShamilSignetSeal_50mm.exr
* COMMENT: LENS: 50mm Macro Anamorphic, f/1.4 | AUDIO_CUE: WaxSeal_And_AhkTash_Gorge_Wind_Layer1
* LOC_TITLE_RU: Кадр 2: Оттиск восьмиугольного перстня Шамиля и выезд чапара
* LOC_TITLE_EN: Shot 2: Shamil's Octagonal Signet Stamp & Chapar Dispatch
* SUBTITLE_EN: "Every decree is sealed in silver. Yet will your courier pierce Freytag's cordons — and will a proud Naib obey?"

003  SHOT_03  V     C        01:00:20:00 01:00:32:00 00:00:20:00 00:00:32:00
* FROM CLIP NAME: LS_SteamTrailer_Shot03_MilyutinCutaway_24mm.exr
* COMMENT: LENS: 24mm Wide Tilt-Shift, f/2.8 | AUDIO_CUE: Safarov_CopperBasin_Sonar_Layer2
