* LOC_TITLE_EN: Shot 3: Milyutin 3D Rock Cutaway & Safarov's Copper Basin Sonar
* SUBTITLE_EN: "Slice the cliffside along Colonel Milyutin's blueprints. Listen to peas trembling on Safarov's copper basin and fire the counter-mine!"

004  SHOT_04  V     C        01:00:32:00 01:00:44:00 00:00:32:00 00:00:44:00
