* LOC_TITLE_RU: Кадр 4: Буковая засека в Ичкерии и залп 18 нагрудных газырей
* LOC_TITLE_EN: Shot 4: Ichkeria Beech Abatis Ambush & 18-Gazyr Volley
* SUBTITLE_EN: "No health bars. Eighteen silver gazyrs across the chest. Drop the beech abatis onto Vorontsov's column and close with Bazalai steel!"

005  SHOT_05  V     C        01:00:44:00 01:00:52:00 00:00:44:00 00:00:52:00
