* LOC_TITLE_EN: Shot 5: Code of Nizams, Sharia Court & 3 Ironman Challenges
* SUBTITLE_EN: "Judge by the Code of Nizams between Adat and Sharia. Benchmark your campaign against 20,000 simulations in al-Karakhi's Chronograph."

006  SHOT_06  V     C        01:00:52:00 01:01:00:00 00:00:52:00 00:01:00:00
